-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §122 (part לא): a young-division head who, on
-- the eve of the school's move, holds the post of a first deputy is on the
-- first deputy's week, pay, conversion and promotion, his week holding the
-- tasks of both posts.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `122`

DECLARE `terms of a young-division head` IS ONE OF `a first deputy's terms`, `a young-division head's terms (part לב)`

@ref akn:art_122
GIVEN `holds a first deputy's post on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of a young-division head`
DECIDE `the young-division head's terms` `holds a first deputy's post on the eve` IS
    IF `holds a first deputy's post on the eve` THEN `a first deputy's terms` ELSE `a young-division head's terms (part לב)`

#ASSERT `the young-division head's terms` TRUE EQUALS `a first deputy's terms`
